# What the setup command writes into a project to connect it to a Archipelago server (/connect/setup.mjs), and the
# notes on this machine's own installation (CLAUDE.local.md). Each is true of one machine's setup, not of the code.
.mcp.json
# The plugin's server entry holds no token: only where the server is (npm run plugin writes it).
!plugins/archipelago/.mcp.json
